# Factor research workspaces are runtime/artifact space by default.
# Do not let concurrent Factor Forge Ultimate research threads dirty the repo
# with results, Step3 runtime copies, caches, PDFs, or large intermediate data.
# To promote a small manifest/report/knowledge file intentionally, use
# explicit `git add -f <path>` after review; never use `git add .`.
